            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Otini kyasïwan nyinte, opïtyan kelyechi le chi nyo kima. Kukanaghanïn ewunyi nyo pö tagh akïlö, “Mewöghisïyi! Ochan nyo pö tagh achï nyo pö löt. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ochan nyinte nyo satate! Kikyameghan, wölo ochan ye satate kokay nko kokay. Otïngetan owesyö ompö meghat nko ngwen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kira nyu tïkwïn cho isïwïyenyi, tïkuchï mi ye nko cho tökïpkonöy ato le löt. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyï nyu wïngutyo kokelyechï le mut nko odeny kesöchinyi ewunyan pö tagh nko kelyechay pö tatïna le mut nko odeny: kokelyechay le odeny, kï kanisen mut nko odeny: kïkany kelyechay le mut nko odeny pö tatïn, kï kanisenichï le mut nko odeny.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.20"
            ]
          }
        }
